{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16845","headline":"天池晚櫂 · 韦臯","name":"天池晚櫂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨霁天池生意足，花间谁咏采莲曲。\n舟浮十里芰荷香，歌发一声山水绿。\n春暖鱼抛水面纶，晚晴鹭立波心玉。\n扣舷归载月黄昏，直至更深不假烛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}